WEBVTT

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:51.610
Let's do it, Melon!

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:54.050
Are we really going to do it?

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:55.490
That is...

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:57.530
After all... I'm not mentally prepared yet.

00:01:57.530 --> 00:01:59.130
I feel it's still too fast.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:00.590
What is this?!

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:03.690
A cell phone bill...

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:04.610
That's right!

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:06.020
Moreover, it's yours!

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.970
And when I look at the amount...

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:10.350
What a shocker!

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:11.420
I-I get it!

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:13.080
I'll do it! I'll get a part-time job!

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:16.550
Since it's my own cell phone, I should be paying it regularly myself...

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:17.830
Good!

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:19.160
Hey, don't worry.

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:21.560
The master at this part-time workplace is a very good person.

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:25.320
After all, he's one of the rare adults I actually respect.

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:26.330
I see.

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:28.390
If he's a good person, then I guess it's okay.

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:38.910
You...

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:40.810
You've hardly contacted me,

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:45.470
Every child who has worked at this shop is family.

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:50.010
Well, it's good to see you've become more handsome.

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.680
Master is flaming, as usual.

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:54.410
Did you say... Master?

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:54.950
Hm?

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:57.610
Yes, I'm Bunny Nankai.

00:02:57.970 --> 00:02:59.930
You can call me Bunny-san, okay?

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:01.600
Bunny-san...?

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:03.490
You...

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:04.170
Name?

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:06.930
Daichi Melon.

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:07.730
Okay!

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:12.210
Note: Melo-Melo is a pun on meromero which means "madly in love."

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:10.310
Then, let's call you by “Melo-Melo.”

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:12.410
Melo-Melo?!

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:13.200
Welcome.

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:13.680
Eh?

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:15.760
Ka-Kakeru... aren't you coming?

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:17.060
Of course not.

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:18.750
This is your work.

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:19.990
It's okay.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.770
I'll make you really cute.

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:24.980
Whaaaaaaat?!

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.250
There are only ten minutes left, Yell!

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:29.710
Yes, Owner!

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.410
Kakeru-chan!

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:34.870
What happened?

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:38.170
You appear to be panicking like a middle school student who went to the pool in her bathing suit, which is fine,

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:40.750
but realized she had forgotten her underwear.

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:40.750
Hello, Yell-chan!

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:46.440
A stray dog's instincts are pretty good, yeah?

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:47.740
You bitch!

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:49.820
Najimi, be at ease.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:51.900
I will protect the lower half of your body.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:53.250
At ease?

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:53.910
What the hell?

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:56.480
Yell?

00:03:57.640 --> 00:04:00.960
Owner, we'll be late for that supermarket's time-limited sale.

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:02.390
You're right!

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:04.310
It starts at 4:00 PM, we might not make it.

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:05.490
4:00 PM?

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:07.440
It's already ten minutes past. Is that okay?

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:09.770
Eh? But it's still...

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:11.210
What the?

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:13.310
My watch seems to have stopped working.

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:14.690
Let's have a look at it.

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:16.370
Eh?

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:19.100
Ah! It has indeed stopped working!

00:04:19.360 --> 00:04:20.930
I advise that you take it to be repaired.

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:25.770
But because this cost over 10 million yen, getting it repaired would be expensive.

00:04:25.770 --> 00:04:26.840
10 million?!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.500
But isn't it an inconvenience that it has stopped?

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:32.670
I have a cell phone, so I'll be fine for now.

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:34.690
But...

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:37.180
The ghost of wastefulness will come if we don't make it to the sale.

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:38.240
That's a shame.

00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:39.940
Then why don't you come too?

00:04:39.940 --> 00:04:41.220
To Melon's part-time workplace.

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:43.510
Eh? Melon-chan has started working part-time?

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:44.730
I want to go and check it out!

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:47.330
If Najimi's going, I'm going too.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:48.390
Part-time work?

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:50.250
Hello?!

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:49.590
All right then!

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:51.090
Let's all go together, the four of us!

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:51.820
Hello?!

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.380
Yeah. Let's go, let's go!

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:54.000
Hey! I'm here too!

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:55.610
You were here, Cheesecake-san?

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:57.420
Yes, I was.

00:04:57.760 --> 00:04:58.850
From the start...

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:04.860
Welcome home, Master.

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:08.230
I'm home!

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:10.130
Ah, it's a maid!

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:13.060
So Melon's part-time work is at a maid café!

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:14.430
Maid café?

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:16.220
N-Nose bleed.

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:18.000
Why did you come?

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:19.940
Hey, Melo-Melo!

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.120
Keep your voice down in this house-

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:24.230
Oh, if it isn't Keru-Keru!

00:05:24.230 --> 00:05:26.060
Did you come to see Melo-Melo work?

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:26.800
Yes.

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.910
Are you working properly, Melo-Melo?

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:30.230
Don't call me Melo-Melo!

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:33.000
Isn't this a good opportunity for you to test your service?

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:35.680
Melo-Melo, this is your chance to flourish.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:36.580
See you.

00:05:37.550 --> 00:05:39.780
I'll guide you to your seats.

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:40.860
What did you say?

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.750
I can't really hear you, Melo-Melo.

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:45.620
I'll be guiding you to your seats!

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:49.370
I see, so Melon has started working.

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:52.930
When I heard Kakeru-sama say, “I'm home,”

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:55.890
I actually thought this place was your home.

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.400
My home is not so flashy.

00:06:00.340 --> 00:06:03.080
Master, I've brought you some cold water.

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:07.000
Melo-Melo, you must be gentle when putting down the drinks with your hands.

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:07.960
The water may splash.

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.440
And show more friendliness in your facial expression.

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:12.210
A maid should be more affectionate.

00:06:12.980 --> 00:06:15.750
I apologize deeply, Master.

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:18.110
Take it easy, Kakeru-chan.

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:20.730
Well, just be more careful from now on, okay?

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:22.520
Say “ahh.”

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:26.210
Yummy?

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:28.530
It's delicious, Misaki!

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:32.010
Just then...

00:06:36.590 --> 00:06:41.380
Melo-Melo, haven't I taught you how to properly carry these?

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:45.930
My rival couldn't be as clumsy as that.

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:46.670
What's wrong?

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:48.480
No, nothing!

00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:51.310
Be careful from now on.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:55.650
Hey hey.

00:06:55.650 --> 00:06:58.510
So then, want to celebrate Halloween and Yuririn's birthday together?

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:00.020
Oh, sounds good!

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:02.230
Kakeru-chan, are you listening?

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:02.710
Huh?

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:04.600
Oh, of course, of course.

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:04.320
Stupid...

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:07.520
But I was surprised!

00:07:07.520 --> 00:07:09.810
To think that Melon-chan is working part-time.

00:07:10.310 --> 00:07:11.470
Um, Owner?

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.200
What is it?

00:07:14.170 --> 00:07:16.890
I also want to work part-time, but...

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.160
Huh? Why?

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:19.800
Is there something that you want?

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:20.800
No...

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:22.130
Well, yes...

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.620
What is it that you want?

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.190
I'll buy it for you.

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:28.270
You're always working, so at least...

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:30.370
No. If you did so, it would be meaningless.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:31.900
I must work part-time for it.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:36.180
But, but, Yell, you'll collapse if you work any more than you are now.

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:39.840
If you collapse, who's going to do the housework for me?

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:42.130
I deeply apologize!

00:07:42.490 --> 00:07:43.970
It was just a slight interest.

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:45.890
Please forget about what I said.

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:47.420
Are you sure?

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:48.200
Yes.

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:56.380
Damn that Bunny, down to every last detail...

00:07:57.340 --> 00:08:00.550
Right! Three outs!

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.520
All right! Let's get a home run!

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:17.070
Hey, what did you take this detour for?

00:08:18.370 --> 00:08:20.630
Look, I even came to escort you back.

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:21.350
Let's go home.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:24.650
Yeah.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.800
Don't you want to play catch?

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:29.950
Catch?

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:30.940
At this age?

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:32.850
What are you going to do about gloves?

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:34.200
Can't we just buy them?

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.550
Buy them yourself!

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:38.440
I won't get my paycheck for a while!

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:56.620
There they are.

00:08:57.150 --> 00:08:57.990
Those people...

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:05.710
Everything is for Owner's sake.

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:21.570
Hey, Kakeru-chan!

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:24.460
Shall we go Halloween shopping together today?

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:25.790
Yeah, sounds good.

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:26.730
Woohoo!

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:28.530
Melon, you come too.

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:29.980
You have a day off from work today, right?

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:31.750
I guess that would be fine.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.940
All right! Let's all go together.

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:35.460
Uh, what happened to Yell?

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:37.200
She's already gone home.

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:39.340
She's been acting strange recently.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:41.900
I look around, and she's suddenly gone!

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:44.140
Hey, what are you suddenly so mad about?

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.070
Kakeru-chan, you idiot!

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:49.660
Thank you very much!

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:54.090
Hey, help me out a bit!

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:56.340
Physical work is for the men.

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:58.850
It's fine for girls to just be cute.

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:00.490
Isn't that what you said in elementary school?

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:02.850
Did I say something like that?

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:03.700
You did!

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:07.360
Remember, it was during the Oodama Rolling event back in 3rd grade.

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:07.550
Note: An oodama is a large ball that is pushed by competing teams at a school sports day.

00:10:07.600 --> 00:10:09.210
Oh, that time...

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.780
But, thinking about it now, I'm at an age where I have discretion.

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:15.890
Isn't "ootama korogashi" a name which can have certain meanings?

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:15.890
Note: Kakeru is now talking about big balls/nuts.

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:18.920
You also said the same thing back in elementary school.

00:10:19.060 --> 00:10:20.600
Hey, Kakeru! This-

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:22.410
Hey, isn't that Yell over there?

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:27.990
She should be preparing dinner at this time.

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:31.260
Somehow she's acting strange, don't you think?

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:32.070
She wouldn't be...

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:35.280
hunting Akikan by herself, would she?

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:38.560
Yell wouldn't do something like that behind my back.

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:39.980
Perhaps...

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:42.100
Is there something you know, Kakeru-chan?

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:44.960
As a matter of fact, Yell asked me something before.

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:47.320
"Tell me about a well paying part-time job."

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:48.480
Part-time job?

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:50.300
And what was your answer?

00:10:50.510 --> 00:10:51.210
Something like...

00:10:51.740 --> 00:10:55.500
If it's a night job, then the most profitable way is to use your body intensely.

00:10:56.980 --> 00:10:58.320
Night job?

00:11:01.330 --> 00:11:02.090
A peek...

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:06.730
What in the world did you tell her?!

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:09.290
Well, naturally, I meant it as a joke.

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:12.330
But since it's Yell, she might have taken it seriously.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:14.870
Yell!

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:30.600
Found her?

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:35.200
She asked me to forget about her working, and yet...

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:35.870
Najimi?

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:38.320
We both were able to get along with each other,

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:39.970
I've noticed many of Yell's good points,

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:41.740
and I trusted her sincerely.

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:46.240
I thought she also had the same trust in me.

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:50.120
So I thought she wouldn't have a secret job behind my back...

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:53.470
But to lie to me about her work...

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:57.640
I don't even know what kind of face to pull in front of her anymore.

00:11:57.640 --> 00:11:58.540
Calm down.

00:11:59.020 --> 00:12:00.880
Yell wouldn't lie to you, right?

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:02.510
Kakeru-chan.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.170
She might just unexpectedly be at home,

00:12:04.630 --> 00:12:06.780
waiting for you to return.

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:07.740
All right?

00:12:08.150 --> 00:12:10.210
When Melon comes back, let's go back home.

00:12:30.110 --> 00:12:32.260
Why am I running away?

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:41.210
Hey girl.

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:43.900
You work quite hard with such a petite body.

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:45.670
Well, don't strain yourself.

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:46.490
Yes!

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:48.310
Yell!

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:50.720
What's this?

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:52.190
You're working part-time as a construction worker?

00:12:52.190 --> 00:12:53.580
Don't scare us like that.

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:54.660
Yeah?

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:58.000
Yell, what are you doing?

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:01.870
Why did you deceive me and why are you working part-time?

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:04.640
I'm very sorry, Owner.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:07.770
With you taking up such a dangerous job,

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:09.970
do you know how worried we were?

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:11.900
I apologize deeply.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:13.050
Even so, I still don't understand!

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:16.750
Najimi doesn't understand Yell anymore.

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:19.810
Do what you want!

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:20.610
Najimi!

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:24.870
I'm sorry for causing so much trouble.

00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:25.570
Yell!

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.640
Melon, you go after Yell!

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:31.720
I'll chase after Najimi!

00:13:32.610 --> 00:13:33.190
Kakeru...

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:41.860
Hey, about Yell...

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:43.910
I somehow think she has her reasons.

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:45.540
I know that.

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:46.400
What?

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:50.880
I know there are things that Yell can't speak to me about.

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:54.280
But even though my head understands this...

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:55.570
Is that so?

00:13:56.740 --> 00:13:59.840
When Yell comes back home, tell her properly how you think.

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:02.460
I'm sure you will be fine.

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:08.760
Well then, I'll be going to the shop in front of the station,

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:11.220
since I left all the packages there.

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:15.990
Eh? Melon?

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:17.150
H-Hey!

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:20.620
Where's Yell?

00:14:20.890 --> 00:14:21.990
She won't be coming back home.

00:14:22.260 --> 00:14:22.590
Huh?

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:26.640
Isn't it the end for Akikans whose owners no longer trust them?

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:28.880
It's true, isn't it?

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:31.220
The place where we belong...

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:37.200
You have a delivery!

00:14:38.540 --> 00:14:39.060
Melon...

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:40.190
Liar.

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:42.730
You're a liar!

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:47.020
Liar! Liar! Liar!

00:14:46.470 --> 00:14:47.020
Hey!

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:47.760
What's wrong?

00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:51.060
Liar.

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:53.610
Didn't you say you would never leave me alone?

00:14:55.210 --> 00:14:56.260
You said you wouldn't...

00:14:57.530 --> 00:14:58.200
Melon!

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:00.220
Thank you!

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:06.070
Yell?

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:08.390
Man, what's up with her?

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:11.100
Huh?

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:14.770
Unsent mail?

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:21.410
I've finished my job.

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:24.670
Baseball looks fun!

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:28.940
I'm lonely.

00:15:30.660 --> 00:15:31.840
Let's stay together.

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.130
I want to see you.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:36.560
I want to see you.

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:39.370
I want to see you.

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:43.520
I want to see you.

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:50.820
To my beloved Owner,

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:56.030
Thank you for always looking after me.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:58.190
Please let me show my appreciation by giving you this clock.

00:15:59.720 --> 00:16:01.870
I don't know if you'll like it, but...

00:16:03.470 --> 00:16:05.640
Please use it from now on.

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:08.040
Yell.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:11.150
Yell...

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:12.820
Sorry... I'm sorry!

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:15.090
I didn't know anything.

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:24.360
Yell!

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:26.950
Don't leave, Yell!

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:28.710
Don't go!

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:34.020
Don't leave me behind.

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:35.310
Owner...

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:37.300
Yell...

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:39.310
Please don't cry, Owner.

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:42.000
How could I do such a thing.

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:43.950
No no, you're wrong.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.510
Najimi's the one who's wrong.

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:51.330
I wasn't sure whether I could trust Yell.

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:56.900
You were always completely thinking about me, and yet...

00:16:57.560 --> 00:16:58.940
I'm sorry, Yell.

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:02.930
I... I am such a despicable person.

00:17:03.520 --> 00:17:04.350
Yell?

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:08.090
Even though I should be happy, just by staying by Owner's side,

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:11.300
I wished for you to love me more.

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:14.890
No, that is normal.

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:16.460
I do it too.

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:22.140
Any girl would want the person they admire to like them more.

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:23.210
Owner.

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:26.290
Thank you for the present.

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:28.680
No, thank you for everything!

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:31.200
Yell, I really like you.

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:34.270
Owner!

00:17:43.190 --> 00:17:45.040
Where did she go?

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:11.000
You can't play catch without these, ya know?

00:18:11.510 --> 00:18:12.270
Kakeru...

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:14.410
Let's go!

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:15.990
W-Wait!

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:18.120
Ouch!

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:20.840
It's because you aren't paying attention!

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:22.580
Now you're in for it!

00:18:22.980 --> 00:18:23.920
Here!

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:25.640
Pretty good!

00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:31.220
Don't underestimate a Tigers fan.

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:36.350
This is just my own thought...

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:37.360
About what?

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:43.120
Whether I should feel bad for leaving you alone.

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:47.110
You seem comfortable in this world,

00:18:47.110 --> 00:18:48.370
and you can handle yourself well.

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:51.100
But it seems like you are hopeless without me.

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:53.640
Don't be conceited!

00:18:54.260 --> 00:18:55.350
That's just my own thinking...

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:56.930
But you know...

00:18:57.250 --> 00:19:00.280
If you don't speak to me about it, I also wouldn't know.

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:05.060
If there is something you want to say, just say it.

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:06.950
Not just to yourself.

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.070
I'm lonely.

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:12.020
Although I'm talking to myself...

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:14.610
I'm sorry about that.

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:16.630
What do you want me to do?

00:19:16.950 --> 00:19:17.810
This is me talking to myself.

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.950
There's nothing I particularly want,

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:22.520
even though I'm lonely.

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:23.640
Really?

00:19:24.160 --> 00:19:24.820
Talking to myself...

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:26.130
Yes really!

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:27.050
Talking to myself.

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:30.080
Idiot!

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:32.530
Darn it.

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:33.340
Sorry.

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:38.060
For hurting you again.

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:39.840
I'm truly sorry.

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:41.990
Aren't you talking to yourself?

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:44.220
No, I'm not talking to myself.

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:46.450
Do you want me to do something?

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.050
N-Nothing...

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:49.140
Really?

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:54.910
As long as Kakeru is by my side,

00:19:55.870 --> 00:19:56.640
it is enough.

00:19:58.010 --> 00:19:58.820
Melon...

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:02.750
Wait!

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:04.650
What are you doing?

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:08.440
Well, it's just that you said something so cute.

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:10.950
You're an idiot!

00:20:11.650 --> 00:20:13.310
I'm complimenting you.

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:17.000
The moon is beautiful, don't you think?

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:22.110
You're right.

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:23.470
It's beautiful.

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:31.880
Happy birthday,

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:32.760
Witch!

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:33.330
Kochikaze-san!

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:33.830
And...

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:36.760
Happy Halloween!

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:46.830
Hi!

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:56.970
Hey, don't drink carbonated drinks!

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:03.720
Um, Kochikaze-san...

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:06.290
This is a present from me.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:07.440
Please accept it!

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:09.270
Ah, are you sure?

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:10.280
Eh?

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:12.710
What a nice surprise present!

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:16.910
Amaji, greet our guest appropriately.

00:21:17.160 --> 00:21:19.020
Don't worry about it.

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:22.840
I'm really excited to have suddenly received a confession through a present.

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:26.070
Oh Gigolo, you swung that way?

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:28.440
What do you mean by “swung that way”?

00:21:32.080 --> 00:21:33.440
You're wrong! This is...

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:35.420
Ah, yes yes. That shy expression is good!

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:39.080
Let me make you much cuter.

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:41.460
Oh crap!!!

00:23:15.070 --> 00:23:18.020
Yell, what do you normally do when you're alone?

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:19.310
What about Melon-chan?

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:20.350
What about Budoko-chan?

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:21.440
What about Yell?

00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:22.650
What about Melon-chan?

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:23.790
What about Budoko-chan?

00:23:23.980 --> 00:23:24.830
What about Yell?

00:23:24.830 --> 00:23:25.770
What about Melon-chan?

00:23:25.770 --> 00:23:27.000
What about Budoko-chan?

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:29.400
Hehehe... what about Yell... hehehe?
